<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-SPAIN TAKE WINNING LEAD OVER GERMANY IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SPAIN TAKE WINNING LEAD OVER GERMANY IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>MALLORCA, Spain 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain took a winning 3-1 lead over Germany after winning the first of the reverse singles in their Davis Cup tennis World Group, first round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Hendrik Dreekman (Germany) 6-4 6-4 7-5.</p>
